{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Of his master's camels.</b> They were distinguished from the rest of the camels, for they went out muzzled because of theft, so they would not graze in others' fields (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>And all the good of his master was in his hand.</b> He wrote a deed of gift to Yitzchak for all that he had, so that they would rush to send him their daughter (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>Aram Naharaim.</b> It sits between two rivers."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:06.349861025Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}